E1aQtYrPAAQYQHrTjiJ-t9PwC9pKYn869zj_lKXwA&oe=6B0999A3"}, "display_name": "KUBIKOS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "KUBIKOS set is a set of low poly, cartoony, building blocks. Game contains Egypt world, Platformer world, dungeon, published to date (100+ objects) and will be added to overtime.\n\nFeatures:\n*Add more than 1000+ object with out losing fps\n*Autosave. Your progress never be erased\n*You can build dungeon, castle\n*Build with out limit.\n*One of the best simulation games: begin constructing your dream world\n*Enjoy the visual and sound effects.\n*Build your own construction", "short_description": "You have a huge warehouse at your disposal. there are small remarkable and at the same time unusual objects. Using them you can try to build something original and phenomenal"}]}, "developer_name": "livbogdan", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://livbogdan.wixsite.com/licenggames/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "livbogdan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://livbogdan.wixsite.com/licenggames/kubikos", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24685175144430220"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570299_273231374476615_3780854769626762337_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_c